('fecc3df9-240b-5573-9dfe-2f4d54316656', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '521788f0-c0f7-5ff9-94e2-bd6a8cd8daac', 'a-level', '27.1', '9702 coursebook 27.1 · Alternating current and r.m.s. values', 28, 28, 'A heater is connected to a sinusoidal supply of peak voltage 340 V. Calculate the steady d.c. voltage that would give the same mean power.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '240.4', 'V', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Equivalent d.c. = V_rms = 340 ÷ √2 = 240 V. Mark scheme (4 marks). M1: d.c. equivalent is the r.m.s. value. C1: V_rms = V₀/√2. C1: value. A1: V = 240 V.', 4, NULL, NULL),
('c2dbd804-733c-58fb-aa4f-50eb6f17456c', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '521788f0-c0f7-5ff9-94e2-bd6a8cd8daac', 'a-level', '27.1', '9702 coursebook 27.1 · Alternating current and r.m.s. values', 29, 29, 'A voltage is +4.0 V for half of each cycle and 0 V for the other half. Calculate its r.m.s. value.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2.828', 'V', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Mean of V² = (4.0² + 0) ÷ 2 = 8.0 V². V_rms = √8.0 = 2.83 V. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: mean of the squares. C1: square root. A1: V_rms = 2.83 V.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg23640e28-t fg23640e28-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg23640e28-t">Rectangular voltage</title><desc id="fg23640e28-d">Graph of voltage against time t: the voltage is +4.0 V for the first half of each period T and 0 V for the second half. Two periods are shown.</desc><line x1="33" y1="242" x2="388" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="33" y1="242" x2="33" y2="28" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="392,242 385.7,245 385.7,239" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><polygon points="33,24 36,30.3 30.1,30.3" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="33" y1="242" x2="33" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="33" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="207.5" y1="242" x2="207.5" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="207.5" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">T</text><line x1="382" y1