('29cb08c0-7c66-523a-a963-d24f3e109eee', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '1dcc934a-cbaa-4233-91fd-46dc3b235528', 'a-level', '27.2', '9702 coursebook 27.2 · Alternating voltages', 44, 44, 'One cycle of a trace spans 3.5 ± 0.1 divisions with the time-base at 1.0 ms per division. (a) Calculate the frequency. (b) Calculate its percentage uncertainty. Give only the answer to (a).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '285.7', 'Hz', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) T = 3.5 ms, so f = 1 ÷ 3.5 × 10⁻³ = 286 Hz. (b) Percentage uncertainty = 0.1 ÷ 3.5 × 100 = 2.86 %. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: T from trace. C1: f = 1/T. C1: percentage. B1: f and T have equal percentage uncertainty. A1: f = 286 Hz.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('3c123a89-1393-5290-b6b1-207cb97cffee', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '1dcc934a-cbaa-4233-91fd-46dc3b235528', 'a-level', '27.2', '9702 coursebook 27.2 · Alternating voltages', 45, 45, 'A signal is V = 3.0 + 4.0 sin ωt, in volts: a steady 3.0 V plus a sinusoidal part of peak 4.0 V. (a) State the maximum and minimum values of V. (b) Use V_rms² = (d.c. part)² + (sinusoidal peak)²/2 to calculate the r.m.s. value. (c) Calculate the mean power it delivers to a 17 Ω resistor. Give only the answer to (b).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '4.123', 'V', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Maximum 7.0 V, minimum −1.0 V. (b) V_rms² = 3.0² + 4.0² ÷ 2 = 17 V², so V_rms = √17 = 4.12 V. (c) P = 17 ÷ 17 = 1.0 W. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: max and min. C1: V_rms². C1: square root. C1: P = V_rms²/R. B1: d.c. and a.c. parts add in quadrature. A1: V_rms = 4.12 V.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fge5d1933a-t fge5d1933a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fge5d1933a-t">Sine wave with a steady offset</title><desc id="fge5d1933a-d">Graph of V = 3.0 + 4.0 sin ωt against time t over two periods T: a sine wave of peak 4.0 V centred on a dashed line at the steady 3.0 V level.</desc><line x1="33" y1="198" x2="388" y2="198" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="33" y1="242" x2="33" y2="28" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="392,198 385.7,201 385.7,195" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><polygon points="33,24 36,30.3 30.1,30.3" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="33" y1="198" x2="33" y2="202" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="33" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" domina