('c506e6b3-6a83-521d-a9b6-93f8a14147de', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '71ba01f7-9a9e-5018-974d-21999c276ce5', 'a-level', '27.4', '9702 coursebook 27.4 · Rectification and smoothing', 35, 35, 'A smoothing circuit has RC = 0.47 s and is fed by a full-wave rectifier on a 50 Hz supply. Calculate (time constant) ÷ (time between peaks).', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '47', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Time between peaks = 1 ÷ 100 = 0.010 s. Ratio = 0.47 ÷ 0.010 = 47. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: time between peaks. C1: ratio. A1: ratio = 47.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('071b29e1-c954-5d22-9d03-8bddb284f6e1', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '71ba01f7-9a9e-5018-974d-21999c276ce5', 'a-level', '27.4', '9702 coursebook 27.4 · Rectification and smoothing', 36, 36, 'One diode in a bridge rectifier fails, becoming an open circuit. What happens to the output?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'It becomes half-wave rectified', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Only the path through the working pair of diodes remains for one half cycle. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: one current path lost. C1: half-wave output. A1: B (It becomes half-wave rectified).', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 456 270" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg9c4f79c4-t fg9c4f79c4-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg9c4f79c4-t">Bridge rectifier with a failed diode</title><desc id="fg9c4f79c4-d">Circuit: an a.c. supply feeding a bridge of four diodes with a load across the output. The lower-right diode has failed and is drawn as a break in the circuit.</desc><line x1="97" y1="40" x2="227" y2="40" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="97" y1="200" x2="227" y2="200" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="97" y1="40" x2="97" y2="108" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="97" y1="132" x2="97" y2="200" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><circle cx="97" cy="120" r="12" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><path d="M90,120 q3.5,-7 7,0 t7,0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="227" y1="40" x2="256.1" y2="73.2" style="stroke:currentColor;