('49034181-bb96-5a9b-8682-c334e82e14ea', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '71ba01f7-9a9e-5018-974d-21999c276ce5', 'a-level', '27.4', '9702 coursebook 27.4 · Rectification and smoothing', 44, 44, 'A power supply delivers 50 mA to a load from a full-wave rectifier on a 50 Hz supply. The ripple must be no more than 0.20 V. (a) Calculate the charge supplied to the load between peaks. (b) Calculate the smoothing capacitance needed, in µF. Give only the answer to (b).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2500', 'µF', false, NULL, false, ARRAY['0.0025']::text[], '(a) ΔQ = It = 0.050 × 0.010 = 5.0 × 10⁻⁴ C. (b) C = ΔQ/ΔV = 5.0 × 10⁻⁴ ÷ 0.20 = 2.5 × 10⁻³ F. In µF: 2.5 × 10⁻³ × 10⁶ = 2500. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: t = 0.010 s. C1: ΔQ = It. M1: C = ΔQ/ΔV. C1: value. C1: conversion. A1: C = 2500 µF.', 6, NULL, NULL),
('46b89f11-b8da-5300-be23-9ae43dd64d38', '94fd6e1e-0c0d-4097-b9f4-51457e7b9b07', '71ba01f7-9a9e-5018-974d-21999c276ce5', 'a-level', '27.4', '9702 coursebook 27.4 · Rectification and smoothing', 45, 45, 'A full-wave rectifier on a 50 Hz supply feeds 0.12 A to a load through a 1000 µF smoothing capacitor. (a) Calculate the charge delivered between peaks. (b) Calculate the ripple. Give only the answer to (b).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.2', 'V', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) ΔQ = 0.12 × 0.010 = 1.2 × 10⁻³ C. (b) ΔV = ΔQ/C = 1.2 × 10⁻³ ÷ 1000 × 10⁻⁶ = 1.2 V. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: t between peaks. C1: ΔQ. M1: ΔV = ΔQ/C. C1: value. A1: ΔV = 1.2 V.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 456 270" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgd6e93570-t fgd6e93570-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgd6e93570-t">Smoothed rectifier</title><desc id="fgd6e93570-d">Circuit: an a.c. supply feeding a full-wave bridge of four diodes; a 1000 µF smoothing capacitor and the load are in parallel across the output.</desc><line x1="97" y1="40" x2="227" y2="40" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="97" y1="200" x2="227" y2="200" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="97" y1="40" x2="97" y2="108" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="97" y1="132" x2="97" y2="200" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><circle cx="97" cy="120" r="12" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><path d="M90,120 q3.5,-7 7,0 t7,0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="227" y1="40" x2="256.1"